/14/code.py:322:    - For the target region, interpret the marker color as the boundary side that the marker must attach toward. The single\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/898e7135/26/code.py:233:    - Inside that frame, each slot is already filled by its own non-frame marker color instead of background.\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/7491f3cf/D5/0/code.py:54:#    No extra marker color is introduced. Prefill uses the same two source colors as\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/6e4f6532/12/code.py:12:     number of 9-cells, then marker colors fixed the rotation/flip.\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/6e4f6532/12/code.py:441:    larger 8-bodies dock to larger 9-stations, while marker colors still determine the docking orientation.\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/8f3a5a89/D8/0/code.py:154:    assert other_cols, \\\"no non-bg non-marker colors found; cannot determine wall color\\\"\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/898e7135/45/code.py:98:  - The corresponding outside pieces are visibly multicolor, and the marker colors align with specific block\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/898e7135/45/code.py:503:      block colors at the marked slot-adjacent positions match the wall-marker colors.\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/8f3a5a89/D8/1/code.py:83:    assert other_cols, \\\"no non-bg non-marker colors found; cannot determine wall color\\\"\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/d35bdbdc/18/code.py:31:#   the sprite component, so marker color must be excluded during sprite detection.\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/d35bdbdc/18/code.py:71:# - Assumption: marker color 2 is reserved for singleton markers. Guarantee: sprite palette excludes 2.\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/d35bdbdc/18/code.py:134:    \\\"\\\"\\\"Markers are singleton 4-connected components of the reserved marker color.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/898e7135/27/code.py:54:  - The tie-break does not depend on numeric color ordering or invisible metadata: the visible marker colors\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/898e7135/27/code.py:69:  - Each designated marker color equals the color of the corresponding anchor block in the correct filled-in\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/8f3a5a89/D1/0/code.py:188:    assert other_cols, \\\"no non-bg non-marker colors found; cannot determine wall color\\\"\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/8f3a5a89/D1/2/code.py:215:    assert other_cols, \\\"no non-bg non-marker colors found; cannot determine wall color\\\"\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c4d067a0/16/code.py:35:#    - Only two legend colors are special: one unique anchor color and one unique marker color.\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c4d067a0/16/code.py:327:    - marker color is unique and distinct,\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/8f3a5a89/D3/0/code.py:45:#      non-marker color; the generator preserves that.\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/8f3a5a89/D3/0/code.py:130:    assert other_cols, \\\"no non-bg non-marker colors found; cannot determine wall color\\\"\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/33/code.py:70:#   The mapping is identity: the source marker color is the ray color. No palette ranking,\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/8f3a5a89/D3/1/code.py:52:#     - counts-based marker detection still assumes the marker color occurs once.\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/8f3a5a89/D3/1/code.py:140:    # Wall color: most frequent non-bg, non-marker color.\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/8f3a5a89/D3/1/code.py:142:    assert other_cols, \\\"no non-bg non-marker colors found; cannot determine wall color\\\"\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/898e7135/53/code.py:33:    - D14/0: slots are no longer bg holes; each slot is painted in its own marker color.\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/898e7135/53/code.py:34:      A corner legend tells which piece color belongs to which marker color.\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/co